  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>gwr-nonstationarity-test</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{observedStandardDeviation}{s_k}&amp;=\\operatorname{sd}_i\\,\\beta_{ik},\n&amp;\\term{simulatedMean}{\\bar s_k}&amp;=\\frac{1}{P}\\sum_{p=1}^{P}s_k^{(p)}\\\\\n\\term{exceedances}{g_k}&amp;=\\#\\{p:\\ s_k^{(p)}\\ge s_k\\},\n&amp;\\term{pseudoPValue}{p_k}&amp;=\\frac{g_k+1}{\\term{permutationCount}{P}+1}\\\\\n\\term{zSimulated}{z_k}&amp;=\\frac{s_k-\\bar s_k}{\\term{simulatedDeviation}{\\sigma_{s_k}}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">s_k = population standard deviation of the local estimates beta_ik over the tracts with a finite fit. Permutation p relabels (X, y) among the tracts with a keyed swap-or-not shuffle, refits every tract at the bandwidth already selected on the observed data, and records s_k^(p). g_k = number of permutations with s_k^(p) &gt;= s_k; pseudo p = (g_k + 1)/(P + 1); z_k = (s_k - mean of s_k^(p))/sd of s_k^(p). Failed permuted fits are left out and counted.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:gwr-nonstationarity-test-finish\" data-value=\"observedStandardDeviation\">observedStandardDeviation · output · observed</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-tile-statistics\" data-value=\"simulatedMean\">simulatedMean · output · mean</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:gwr-nonstationarity-test-finish\" data-value=\"exceedances\">exceedances · intermediate · greater</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-search-init\" data-value=\"pseudoPValue\">pseudoPValue · output · table</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:gwr-nonstationarity-test-finish\" data-value=\"permutationCount\">permutations P · parameter · permutationCount</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:gwr-nonstationarity-test-finish\" data-value=\"zSimulated\">zSimulated · output · simulatedDeviation</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-nonstationarity-test-compiled:gwr-nonstationarity-test-finish\" data-value=\"simulatedDeviation\">simulatedDeviation · intermediate · simulatedDeviation</button></div><div class=\"lens-kernels\"></div><p>apple</p></section>",
